{"id":"024b320d234d188f","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-theory.md","title":"真理理论","display":"df-truth-theory — 真理理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-theory","aliases":["91-df-truth-theory"],"display":"df-truth-theory — 真理理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-axiom]]","[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-theory — 真理理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"328ad4f74d95a74b\" href=\"?note=328ad4f74d95a74b\" title=\"91-df-truth-axiom\">91-df-truth-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-theory-—-真理理论-$\\mathcal{T}_T$\">df-truth-theory — 真理理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (所选真理公理集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_T\">\\(\\mathcal R_T\\)</span> (所选真理推理规则集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础理论，如 PA)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T,\\mathcal R_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T,\\mathcal R_T}\\)</span> (经典逻辑加规则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_T\">\\(\\mathcal R_T\\)</span> 的演绎闭包)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathcal T_T(S,\\mathcal A_T,\\mathcal R_T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T,\\mathcal R_T}\n(S\\cup\\mathcal A_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathcal T_T(S,\\mathcal A_T,\\mathcal R_T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T,\\mathcal R_T}\n(S\\cup\\mathcal A_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T\\)</span> : 真理理论（在基础理论上添加真理公理）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> : 基础理论（通常为PA或其变体）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_T\">\\(\\mathcal R_T\\)</span>：除经典背景逻辑外额外采用的真理规则；无额外规则时可为空</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理理论是在基础理论上添加某组真理公理和可选真理规则所得的演绎闭包。不同理论并不都同时包含 T-模式与全部组合公理。例如可能采用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个合适的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))\\)</span></li>\n<li>对编码操作正确量化的合取、量词等组合公理</li>\n<li>捕获/释放一类规则</li>\n</ul>\n<p>尤其不能把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n当作所有型自由真理理论共有的否定公理；它会把“未真”与“为假”混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-theory-—-真理理论-$\\mathcal{T}_T$","text":"df-truth-theory — 真理理论 $\\mathcal{T}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"328ad4f74d95a74b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T$ (扩展语言, see [[91-df-language-with-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T,\\mathcal R_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathcal T_T(S,\\mathcal A_T,\\mathcal R_T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T,\\mathcal R_T}\n(S\\cup\\mathcal A_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1919,"backlinks":[{"id":"83345981d6558f8e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T}_T$ (真理理论, see [[91-df-truth-theory]])"},{"id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c5085dd84d7b744a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"656104419469b4d0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"594ebea503d1a5bb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · dep